# Black Swan — copy to backend/.env and (optionally) add Gemini keys.
# The project runs WITHOUT any keys: TimesFM + behavioral agents drive the
# market, and the newsroom/desk fall back to factual wire prose computed
# from real simulation data. Keys add LLM-written news, PR posts, analyst
# narrative, and richer desk chat. Get free keys: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY_PRIMARY=
GEMINI_API_KEY_BACKUP=

# Optional: defaults to sqlite:///./blackswan.db
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/blackswan
